Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:58:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/43] minimize: write a pid file at start for the App List

The App List hid the apps the taskbar shows whenever the taskbar binary
was installed, also while the taskbar was not running. The taskbar now
writes its pid to $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/minimize-ws/taskbar.pid (under
~/.cache without a runtime dir), so the App List can check that it runs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BLrpLktNVQBZowKMy1ebh2

